{"schema":"coldigom.gestures/1","title":"175 - UM CERTO PASTORZINHO","dictionaryVersion":0,"items":[{"type":"gesture","gestureId":"b980f44702da","lyrics":[{"trigger":"Um certo","text":"pastorzinho, Que se chamou Davi,"}]},{"type":"gesture","gestureId":"4ec15317b2fc","lyrics":[{"trigger":"Era mui","text":"pequeno,"}]},{"type":"gesture","gestureId":"81338f2f401e","lyrics":[{"trigger":"não","text":"confiava em si;"}]},{"type":"gesture","gestureId":"e85f23d78567","lyrics":[{"trigger":"Ele, com","text":"ousadia,"}]},{"type":"gesture","gestureId":"ce94a962b0e0","lyrics":[{"trigger":"orando","text":"sempre a Deus,"}]},{"type":"gesture","gestureId":"b10379e0b47a","lyrics":[{"trigger":"Foi enfrentar,","text":"um dia, o herói dos filisteus."}]},{"type":"gesture","gestureId":"5b707c0153a5","lyrics":[{"trigger":"Na funda uma","text":"pedra colocou,"}]},{"type":"gesture","gestureId":"69501e19f1b7","lyrics":[{"trigger":"E girou,girou, girou;","text":""}]},{"type":"gesture","gestureId":"69501e19f1b7","lyrics":[{"trigger":"Mais","text":"uma vez,"}]},{"type":"gesture","gestureId":"69501e19f1b7","lyrics":[{"trigger":"mais","text":"outra vez,"}]},{"type":"gesture","gestureId":"69501e19f1b7","lyrics":[{"trigger":"Mais","text":"uma vez girou,"}]},{"type":"gesture","gestureId":"068bfdbf89d0","lyrics":[{"trigger":"E a pedra","text":"atirou, o alvo acertou,"}]},{"type":"gesture","gestureId":"39fc6049dce2","lyrics":[{"trigger":"E o gigante","text":"ao chão tombou!"}]}]}